        "credit": "Samir K El-Mofty",
        "license": "CC BY 2.5",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Histopathology_of_basaloid_squamous_cell_carcinoma.png"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "heading": "Perineural invasion & extranodal extension (ENE)",
      "points": [
       "Perineural invasion (especially extratumoural or large-nerve involvement) is a core adverse feature guiding adjuvant chemoradiation.",
       "Pathological ENE upstages a single ipsilateral node <= 3 cm to pN2a and any larger/multiple/contralateral node to pN3b."
      ],
